p Disorder?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In simple words, sleep disorder is the inability to fall asleep. But if we look at it more carefully, it is way more serious than that. Sleep is the body\u2019s way of recharging, having a sleep disorder can directly affect your daytime functioning as well. And with the active hustle and bustle of life, peer pressure to socialize, anxiety, responsibilities, and thousands of other factors, this has become way more common than you think. Here\u2019s a graph to put things in perspective:<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/lh7-us.googleusercontent.com\/5WtdWdgCYxIU2rlcB2AY_1kZY3Wl9aHE9PEB1ZzQcRqc9VDiLggskl0F7xog1iQlNTJH3olEvv1sfoTCN5nJj6ivENlvbJBbmfW0HOLTH_lVQQzZfBhDiiyGE6nTU28z5hEsIjjZBGJM4kzt1vLLaTY\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">&nbsp;Source: helsestart.no<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How are Sleep Disorders Related to Dentistry?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The causes of sleep disorders and their methods of treatment may vary vastly. Seeing the cause and the treatment, sleep disorders can fall under a few different categories, and each will require a separate specialist in that particular field to help you diagnose.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>ENT doctors will help you correct sleep apnea with the help of surgery.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pulmonologists will help you correct your sleep disorders with a machine called CPAP(Continuous Positive Airway Pressure).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sleep medicine specialists specialize in sleep medicines to cure a wide range of sleep apnea.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Neurologists help you cure sleep disorders by treating the brain\u2019s role in sleep regulation.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Psychiatrists and Psychologists help you when sleep disorders are linked to mental health issues like anxiety, depression, or stress.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>And finally, the ones we will go in-depth about are Dentists\/Oral Maxillofacial Surgeons who specialize in dental health and jaw structure. These professionals can provide oral appliances like the Mandibular Advancement Device (M.A.D) for sleep apnea. They focus on how the positioning of the jaw and oral structures affect airway patency during sleep.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So if your sleep disorders are affected or elevated due to your jaw structure, which eventually leads to heavy snoring, then here is a list of dentists and sleep specialists that can help you out.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6 Best Doctors for Sleep Apnea Treatment in India<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Find the list of the best sleep disorder doctors in India who are providing treatment with affordable fee. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">01. Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar is one of the best sleep disorder treatment doctors in India with 16 years of experience. She specializes in Sleep Disorders, TMJ (Temporomandibular Joint Disorders), and Orofacial Pain. Dr Dhivya, co-founder of <a href=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/\">Dr. Dilip Dental Centre<\/a>, along with her team has a very meticulous approach to treating sleep apnea caused due to snoring and jaw structure.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The dental center has state-of-the-art facilities and modern equipment to deal with these issues. They have a dedicated sleep lab, where they conduct tests and pinpoint the issue. A thorough sleep study is done along with several tests, and if their sleep apnea problems fall under their expertise, they provide the best solution to make it better.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Academic and Professional Qualifications:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dr. Dhivya did her UG in dentistry from Dr. M.G.R. Medical University in 2